    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstObjective
      value: Find Flowy
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: thirdObjective
      value: Bring fertilizer
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondObjective
      value: Bring her some water
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'You''re the Best <3 '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: I hope we don't see more of that nasty mist around here, i'm getting
        a little light headed from that.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: I hope we don't see more of that nasty mist around here
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: I hope we don't see more of that nasty mist around here
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: duringFertilizerQuestDialogue.lines.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37a0b0d9cd0afb147a8ab26fab5b86d8, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37a0b0d9cd0afb147a8ab26fab5b86d8, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[2].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37a0b0d9cd0afb147a8ab26fab5b86d8, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: afterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[3].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37a0b0d9cd0afb147a8ab26fab5b86d8, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: The same man, who hurt your wing is trying to get rid of you again!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: I'm also starting to feel nautious.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: In order for me to keep helping your wing, I will need the water. Now
        more than ever
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: You will have to find a way to get rid of that awfull cloud
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: See if you find a way to do that before trying to bring water here
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: duringWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: there has to be something to get rid of the mist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: duringWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Maybe something to disperse it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 83b74ebf136933146b1aafea35aa0b73, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
