      propertyPath: duringWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 26fd4351cebb11442be4e121cb44d59e, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: duringWaterQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].portrait
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9972099221dd7b046997d588efeb78bf, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeFertilizerQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Wow, you found a way, thank you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeFertilizerQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Lately there has been less and less fertilizer to go around aswell
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: beforeFertilizerQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Look around and see if you could find some
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: duringFertilizerQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: I'm certain there has to be some around this house
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
      propertyPath: duringFertilizerQuestDialogue.lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Try to check all the corners, there are some baskets there that could
        have some.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4139366882888764315, guid: 72d7b3b79c13fdd4f92e7a8aedb2e394, type: 3}
